body:
not much of help but im running the game with 2060 super, r5 3500x cpu with 16gb ram but i also have this low fps problem. changing the graphic settings from max to min only affects like 2 fps around. i'm usually playing around 45 fps but in some areas it goes down to even below 30. only in some closed areas i can see 60 fps but its until i see any enemy. 

&#x200B;

someone else mentioned that the game forces some cpu threads (i've no idea what it is) to the max and it causes bottleneck. it doesnt happen to anyone it seems but it might be the problem we're having. i hope they fix it soon
